<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN ASLK, NMKN CUT CERTIFICATE RATES.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN ASLK, NMKN CUT CERTIFICATE RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian banks ASLK-CGER and NMKN-SNCI said in statements on Friday they plan to lower the interest rates on their bank savings certificates.</p>
<p>From Monday CGER cuts five-year rates to 5.00 percent from 5.45 percent. From Tuesday, SNCI cuts five-year capitalisation certificate yields to 5.50 percent from 5.50.</p>
<p>Certificates with yields between one and four years are also lowered.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
